; One block with two fixes: A carries cavern's "reference" keyword, which
; marks a fix cavern keeps even when no leg uses it, and B is a plain fix.
; The keyword is part of the *fix command, so the coordinate is "10 20 30".
*begin ref
*fix A reference 10 20 30
*fix B 1 2 3
*data normal from to tape compass clino
A B 10.0 0 0
*end ref
